{"content":"It seems there is a persistent issue with the interface. Let's manually perform the calculation and present the result.\n\nThe formula for percentage change is:\n\\[ \\text{Percentage Change} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{New Value} - \\text{Old Value}}{\\text{Old Value}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nHere, the old value is $224 (balance at April 1, 2007) and the new value is $168 (balance at March 31, 2008).\n\nLet's calculate it step-by-step:\n1. Calculate the difference between the new value and the old value:\n\\[ 168 - 224 = -56 \\]\n\n2. Divide the difference by the old value:\n\\[ \\frac{-56}{224} = -0.25 \\]\n\n3. Multiply by 100 to get the percentage:\n\\[ -0.25 \\times 100 = -25\\% \\]\n\nThe percentage change in the balance of unrecognized tax benefits from 2007 to 2008 is \\(-25\\%\\).\n\nFinal answer:\n```json\n{\n  \"final\": \"-25%\"\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":8.275942002888769,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":266,"generated_token_ids":[2132,4977,1052,374,264,24999,4265,448,279,3749,13,6771,594,20083,2736,279,21937,323,3042,279,1102,382,785,14806,369,11414,2297,374,510,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,10388,92,284,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,35702,1318,90,3564,5162,92,481,1124,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,35702,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,1124,1291,8,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,1124,2533,8420,11,279,2310,897,374,400,17,17,19,320,21571,518,5813,220,16,11,220,17,15,15,22,8,323,279,501,897,374,400,16,21,23,320,21571,518,5470,220,18,16,11,220,17,15,15,23,3593,10061,594,11047,432,3019,14319,29208,510,16,13,20517,279,6672,1948,279,501,897,323,279,2310,897,510,78045,220,16,21,23,481,220,17,17,19,284,481,20,21,1124,2533,17,13,62902,279,6672,553,279,2310,897,510,78045,1124,37018,19999,20,21,15170,17,17,19,92,284,481,15,13,17,20,1124,2533,18,13,71059,553,220,16,15,15,311,633,279,11414,510,78045,481,15,13,17,20,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,284,481,17,20,59,4,1124,2533,785,11414,2297,304,279,8172,315,96139,3742,7567,504,220,17,15,15,22,311,220,17,15,15,23,374,1124,4080,17,20,